solutions are $n=-4,\\,\\pm 3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-13e7c99c-7aef-53e8-bc54-39657119aa8b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-13e7c99c-7aef-53e8-bc54-39657119aa8b" :answer-field/id #uuid "13e7c99c-7aef-53e8-bc54-39657119aa8b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-76ad3e93-1d3d-503f-8bae-2aba16bc094a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-3add8b77-2674-550c-8c5e-937aa20f6757" "answer-76ad3e93-1d3d-503f-8bae-2aba16bc094a" "answer-6eaa3045-538f-5532-93c9-eb9d97b92258" "answer-7af9e36f-385d-53ce-95da-8a882f9bdffc" "answer-e11cb217-db6f-574c-b615-bccc13fddfb5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3add8b77-2674-550c-8c5e-937aa20f6757" :answer/id #uuid "3add8b77-2674-550c-8c5e-937aa20f6757" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "n=-3,\\,\\pm 4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-76ad3e93-1d3d-503f-8bae-2aba16bc094a" :answer/id #uuid "76ad3e93-1d3d-503f-8bae-2aba16bc094a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "n=-4,\\,\\pm 3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6eaa3045-538f-5532-93c9-eb9d97b92258" :answer/id #uuid "6eaa3045-538f-5532-93c9-eb9d97b92258" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "n=-4,\\,\\pm \\sqrt{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7af9e36f-385d-53ce-95da-8a882f9bdffc" :answer/id #uuid "7af9e36f-385d-53ce-95da-8a882f9bdffc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "n=3,\\,4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e11cb217-db6f-574c-b615-bccc13fddfb5" :answer/id #uuid "e11cb217-db6f-574c-b615-bccc13fddfb5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "n=3,\\,\\pm 4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-f84ff77e-8bf5-5075-9613-766131045ace" :question/id #uuid "f84ff77e-8bf5-5075-9613-766131045ace" :question/math-academy-id "q-14112" :question/problem "Solve ${b}^{3}-2{b}^{2}-6b+12=0.$" :question/worked-solution "We proceed to factor the left-hand side by grouping:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}^{3}-2{b}^{2}-6b+12 & = \\\\ ({b}^{3}-2{b}^{2})-(6b-12) & = \\\\ {b}^{2}(b-2)-6(b-2) & = \\\\ (b-2)\\cdot {b}^{2}-(b-2)\\cdot 6 & = \\\\ (b-2)({b}^{2}-6) & .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we solve $(b-2)({b}^{2}-6)=0$ by setting each factor equal to $0.$\n\n- Setting the factor $(b-2)$ equal to $0,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b-2 & =0 \\\\ b & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Setting the factor $({b}^{2}-6)$ equal to $0,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}^{2}-6 & =0 \\\\ {b}^{2} & =6 \\\\ b & =\\pm \\sqrt{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $b=2,\\,\\pm \\sqrt{6}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-d1b7f4c0-b2be-59fc-8152-805b6f3979f3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-d1b7f4c0-b2be-59fc-8152-805b6f3979f3" :answer-field/id #uuid "d1b7f4c0-b2be-59fc-8152-805b6f3979f3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-6c1a9d65-2293-5d5e-9f4e-2c1c6fcac3c4" :answer-field/choices ["answer-7c7a2077-299f-502c-adf4-ae9a95c25adf" "answer-6c1a9d65-2293-5d5e-9f4e-2c1c6fcac3c4" "answer-119d80a3-bd05-5a7c-b5ae-cdf8a3ef5ae5" "answer-66dd4cf7-8361-590f-810d-636e15e606bb" "answer-db1f75da-0620-5683-966e-82579ca015c0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7c7a2077-299f-502c-adf4-ae9a95c25adf" :answer/id #uuid "7c7a2077-299f-502c-adf4-ae9a95c25adf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "b=2,\\,\\pm \\sqrt{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6c1a9d65-2293-5d5e-9f4e-2c1c6fcac3c4" :answer/id #uuid "6c1a9d65-2293-5d5e-9f4e-2c1c6fcac3c4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "b=2,\\,\\pm \\sqrt{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-119d80a3-bd05-5a7c-b5ae-cdf8a3ef5ae5" :answer/id #uuid "119d80a3-bd05-5a7c-b5ae-cdf8a3ef5ae5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "b=4,\\,\\pm \\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} 